# Token & maintenance optimization

- Prefer Shared patterns in `AGENTS.md` over new copies (id, parse, pick-image, image-persist, api-client, vision-transport, confirm-destructive, `useResponsive` / `AppText fit`, agent-ui).
- Open the smallest feature entry first; domain maps live in `.cursor/skills/<domain>/`.
- Touched screen >700 lines + non-trivial UI → extract a colocated panel.
- UI changes: [`responsive-layout.mdc`](./responsive-layout.mdc) + agent-ui skill for verify.
- After substantive edits: `npm run typecheck` + focused tests. Device/simulator verification is opt-in only and requires an explicit request in the current task.

Do not reintroduce: personal identifiers, raw `Alert`, ad-hoc IDs, hard-coded chrome `fontSize`, interactive controls without `ontrack.*` testIDs, screenshot-coordinate taps.
